  «text (0,5200) 1.6 7 1 0x1000000 -1 -1 "ï»¿SHUFFLER 2 - converter between PV2+ (T) and GND (B) with the midpoint on PV3+ (M): the hand-drawn v3 power stage (mirror image of converter 1)"Â»
  «text (0,4800) 1 7 1 0x1000000 -1 -1 "ï»¿Leg A = M5 / M6 (driver X8, PWM_AH / PWM_AL), leg B = M7 / M8 (driver X9, PWM_BH / PWM_BL); X5 = ERUC23 inverse-coupled inductor."Â»
  «text (0,4600) 1 7 1 0x1000000 -1 -1 "ï»¿Board capacitors C2 / C4 (130 uF) and C6 (225 nF); V5 (A) and V6 (B) = 0 V sources in the windings, positive into the midpoint."Â»
  «text (0,4400) 1 7 1 0x1000000 -1 -1 "ï»¿Ports: T / M / B = the converter rails (cable and copper inductances are on the top sheet); PWM_* = 3.3 V logic from the Controller block;"Â»
  «text (0,4200) 1 7 1 0x1000000 -1 -1 "ï»¿HS_A / HS_B = TMCS1126 hall-sensor outputs to the Controller (1.65 V + 100 mV/A on A, 1.65 V - 25 mV/A on B: reversed as mounted on the board)."Â»
  «text (0,4000) 1 7 1 0x1000000 -1 -1 "ï»¿Measure the winding currents from the top sheet as I(V5â€¢XS2) and I(V6â€¢XS2); their difference is the circulating current, their sum the shuffled current."Â»
  «text (3000,-3800) 1.2 7 1 0x1000000 -1 -1 "ï»¿TMCS1126 HALL SENSORS - on the board at the inductor; 1k + 318.3p = the 500 kHz output pole"Â»
